# Common Patterns & Workflows

## Generating a Landing Page from Content

**User Request:** "Generate a landing page from .content/example.md"

**Workflow:**

1. **Read the content file**
```typescript
// Read .content/example.md
```

2. **Parse frontmatter and content**
```markdown
---
sections: [hero-centered, features-grid, cta-simple]
---

# Headline
Subtitle text
[Button](#)

---

## Features
### Feature 1
Description 1
```

3. **Map to components**
- hero-centered → [HeroCentered](mdc:shared/components/marketing/Hero/HeroCentered.tsx)
- features-grid → [FeaturesGrid](mdc:shared/components/marketing/Features/FeaturesGrid.tsx)
- cta-simple → [CTASimple](mdc:shared/components/marketing/CTA/CTASimple.tsx)

4. **Extract data to props**
```typescript
const heroData = {
  headline: "Headline",
  subtitle: "Subtitle text",
  buttons: [{ text: "Button", href: "#" }]
}
```

5. **Generate page file**
```typescript
// app/example/page.tsx
import type { Metadata } from 'next'
import { HeroCentered, FeaturesGrid, CTASimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'

export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: 'Example',
  description: 'Example page',
}

export default function ExamplePage() {
  return (
    <main>
      <HeroCentered {...heroData} />
      <FeaturesGrid {...featuresData} />
      <CTASimple {...ctaData} />
    </main>
  )
}
```

## Adding a New Section

**User Request:** "Add a pricing section to the page"

**Workflow:**

1. **Ask for content or use template**
   - Check [.content/templates/pricing.md](mdc:.content/templates/pricing.md)
   
2. **Choose component variant**
   - Simple 3-tier: [PricingSimple](mdc:shared/components/marketing/Pricing/PricingSimple.tsx)
   - Comparison table: [PricingComparison](mdc:shared/components/marketing/Pricing/PricingComparison.tsx)

3. **Create data object**
```typescript
const pricingData = {
  title: "Simple Pricing",
  tiers: [
    {
      name: "Starter",
      price: "$0",
      period: "month",
      description: "Perfect for individuals",
      features: ["Feature 1", "Feature 2"],
      cta: { text: "Get Started", href: "#" }
    },
    // More tiers...
  ]
}
```

4. **Add to page**
```typescript
import { PricingSimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'

export default function Page() {
  return (
    <main>
      {/* Existing sections */}
      <PricingSimple {...pricingData} />
    </main>
  )
}
```

## Customizing Component Styling

**User Request:** "Make the hero section darker"

**Workflow:**

1. **Use theme prop**
```typescript
<HeroCentered
  {...data}
  theme="dark"  // Change theme
/>
```

2. **OR customize Tailwind classes** (if component accepts className)
```typescript
<HeroCentered
  {...data}
  className="bg-gray-900 text-white"
/>
```

3. **Available themes:**
- light, dark, gradient, blue, purple

## Creating a New Page

**User Request:** "Create a new /pricing page"

**Workflow:**

1. **Create route directory**
```bash
mkdir -p app/pricing
```

2. **Create page.tsx**
```typescript
// app/pricing/page.tsx
import type { Metadata } from 'next'
import { PricingSimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'

export const metadata: Metadata = {
  title: 'Pricing',
  description: 'Our pricing plans',
}

export default function PricingPage() {
  return (
    <main>
      <PricingSimple {...pricingData} />
    </main>
  )
}

const pricingData = {
  // Pricing data here
}
```

3. **Add to navigation**
Update [shared/components/layout/Header/index.tsx](mdc:shared/components/layout/Header/index.tsx):
```typescript
links={[
  { label: 'Features', href: '#features' },
  { label: 'Pricing', href: '/pricing' },  // Add this
  { label: 'About', href: '/about' },
]}
```

## Component Quick Reference

### Hero Variants

```typescript
// Simple centered
import { HeroSimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<HeroSimple headline="..." subtitle="..." buttons={[...]} />

// With image below
import { HeroCentered } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<HeroCentered headline="..." image="/hero.jpg" />

// Split layout
import { HeroSplit } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<HeroSplit headline="..." image="/hero.jpg" imagePosition="right" />
```

### Features Variants

```typescript
// Grid (2-4 columns)
import { FeaturesGrid } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<FeaturesGrid 
  title="Features" 
  features={[...]} 
  columns={3} 
/>

// List with images
import { FeaturesList } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<FeaturesList 
  title="Features" 
  features={[
    { title: "...", description: "...", image: "/...", bullets: [...] }
  ]} 
/>
```

### Pricing Variants

```typescript
// 3-tier cards
import { PricingSimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<PricingSimple title="Pricing" tiers={[...]} />

// Comparison table
import { PricingComparison } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<PricingComparison 
  title="Compare Plans" 
  tiers={[...]} 
  comparisonFeatures={[...]} 
/>
```

### Testimonials Variants

```typescript
// Grid layout
import { TestimonialsGrid } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<TestimonialsGrid 
  title="What Customers Say" 
  testimonials={[...]} 
  columns={3} 
/>

// Slider/Carousel
import { TestimonialsSlider } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<TestimonialsSlider testimonials={[...]} autoplay={true} />
```

### CTA Variants

```typescript
// Simple centered
import { CTASimple } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<CTASimple 
  headline="Ready?" 
  buttons={[...]} 
  theme="blue" 
/>

// Split with image
import { CTASplit } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
<CTASplit 
  headline="Start Today" 
  benefits={[...]} 
  image="/cta.jpg" 
/>
```

