## Troubleshooting

### Import errors
```typescript
// ❌ WRONG
import { Hero } from '../shared/components/marketing'

// ✅ CORRECT
import { HeroCentered } from '@/shared/components/marketing'
```

### Component not found
1. Check component exists in [shared/components/marketing/](mdc:shared/components/marketing/)
2. Verify import from barrel export (index.tsx)
3. Check spelling and capitalization

### TypeScript errors
1. Check [shared/types/marketing.types.ts](mdc:shared/types/marketing.types.ts)
2. Ensure all required props provided
3. Verify prop types match interface

### Styling not working
1. Ensure using Tailwind utilities
2. Check [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts) includes all paths
3. Verify no CSS modules or inline styles

